"note": "CANDIDATE — named in a tribute-wall entry on Evalee G. Gilpin Emerson's 2021 obituary signed by 'Glenda, Roy, Austyn and Collin Magee', which places them in Glenda and Roy Magee's household. No record states the parent-child relationship directly, so it is recorded as a candidate. SWEEP 2026-10-15 (potentials round 37): negative confirmed by a full offline scan of the Kentucky birth index 1961-1999 (every row of the three index files): the only mother-rows filed under “Glenda Collins” are two Marshall County children — Amilyn Elizabeth Thweatt (born 3 Oct 1986, certificate in Births 1986_99) and Adam Clayton Thweatt (born 25 Aug 1987) — a different woman of the same name and not this Glenda (born October 1977, Grant County). No Magee birth with mother Glenda Collins appears in Kentucky 1961-1999, and no Magee × Collins marriage appears in the Kentucky marriage index 1973-1999. POTENTIALS 2026-10-15 (round 40): exact-name searches of the Ohio birth index (1908-2003) and the U.S. Public Records Index (1994-2019) find no Collin Magee; the Collin / Colin Ohio results (Collin Michael McGee, Colleen, Glenn) belong to other families. Like his brother, he appears in no index found so far — the tribute-wall entry on Evalee G. Gilpin Emerson's 2021 obituary remains the only evidence. SWEEP 2026-10-15 (round 45): the modern lanes come back clean-negative — the Ohio marriage abstracts (1970, 1972-2022) carry no marriage under the name; the Franklin County, Indiana marriage records (1821-1997) carry none; and the U.S. Obituary Collection (1930-current) holds no obituary for this household. Its one Kentucky “Glenda” entry is a different woman — Glenda Sharon Magee, maiden name Crews, spouse Charles Larry Magee — recorded here as rejected, not used. The tribute-wall entry on Evalee G. Gilpin Emerson's 2021 obituary remains the only evidence these two belong to Glenda and Roy's household.\n\nROUND 48 (2026-10-15): the household's other name — Roy Magee, from the same tribute-wall line — was swept for a linking record and is likewise negative. Ohio marriage abstracts (141 fuzzy rows) and divorce abstracts (136): no Roy Magee with a Glenda bride or spouse in either. Kentucky marriage index 1973-1999 under Roy Magee: 51 fuzzy rows, every one read an R-initial Magee/McGee with another spouse. U.S. Public Records Index, Kentucky: 15,681 fuzzy rows, the rows read carrying Roy Magees of Apple Valley (California), Bardstown, Seattle, Gulfport and elsewhere — none in Williamstown or Corinth. U.S. Obituary Collection under Roy Magee: 1,776 fuzzy rows, the Kentucky entries (Somerset, London, and a 1910-1980 man) all other men. The tribute-wall entry remains the only evidence for this household.",
